                        "artifacts":{"type":"array","maxItems":128,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["id","workspaceId","projectId","role","kind","mediaType","contentDigest"],"properties":{"id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/id"},"workspaceId":{"$ref":"#/$defs/id"},"projectId":{"$ref":"#/$defs/id"},"role":{"enum":["patch","summary","output"]},"kind":{"enum":["agent.patch","agent.summary","agent.output"]},"mediaType":{"enum":["text/x-diff","text/markdown","application/octet-stream"]},"contentDigest":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"}}}},
                        "patchArtifactId": {
